      "text": "(\n    <div style={{ backgroundColor: 'var(--color-background)', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontSize: '12px', fontSynthesis: 'none', gap: '40px', height: 'fit-content', lineHeight: '16px', MozOsxFontSmoothing: 'grayscale', overflow: 'clip', overflowWrap: 'anywhere', padding: '48px', WebkitFontSmoothing: 'antialiased', width: '1800px' }}>\n      <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: '8px' }}>\n        <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--color-foreground)', fontFamily: '\"Inter\", system-ui, sans-serif', fontSize: '30px', fontWeight: 600, letterSpacing: '-0.025em', lineHeight: '36px' }}>\n          Posting text\n        </div>\n        <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--color-muted-foreground)', fontFamily: '\"Inter\", system-ui, sans-serif', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '24px', whiteSpace: 'pre-wrap', width: '900px' }}>\n          Post in a member's community header opens this form, so the community is already known and there is no picker. Text is the default; Song and Video open their own flows, each on its own sheet. A text post publishes instantly.<br />On desktop the form replaces the feed in the main column as a card. The sidebar, banner, community name and About card stay; the tabs and header button are hidden while composing. On phone the banner, header and bottom navigation are hidden.<br />One page structure for every stepped or full-screen task (song, video, create community, Study, Karaoke): a header with the way out at the top left and the name of where you are, a body that scrolls, and a footer that holds the one forward button. The way out is a close on the first screen and a back arrow on later steps. This is the ActionFooterShell pattern.<br />Design changes from the code, per the workspace_owner: no permanent \"Create a post\" heading, Cancel or bottom-left Back; the phone forward button is in the footer and labelled; required fields carry an asterisk and nothing is labelled optional; the Title is required.<br />Not drawn yet: a member with no profile chosen for this community.<br />Source: features/posts/text-submission, features/posts/post-composer.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: '16px' }}>\n        <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--color-muted-foreground)', fontFamily: '\"Inter\", system-ui, sans-serif', fontSize: '16px', fontWeight: 500, letterSpacing: '0.03em', lineHeight: '20px', textTransform: 'uppercase' }}>\n          Desktop: text post, in the community page\n        </div>\n        <div style={{ backgroundColor: 'var(--color-background)', borderColor: 'var(--color-border-soft)', borderStyle: 'solid', borderWidth: '1px', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', width: '1280px' }}>\n          <div style={{ alignSelf: 'stretch', backgroundColor: 'var(--color-sidebar)', borderRightColor: 'var(--color-sidebar-border)', borderRightStyle: 'solid', borderRightWidth: '1px', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', flexShrink: '0', padding: '16px', width: '248px' }}>\n            <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexBasis: '0%', flexDirection: 'column', flexGrow: '1', gap: '20px', minHeight: '0px' }}>\n              <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: '4px' }}>\n                <div style={{ alignItems: 'center', borderRadius: 'var(--radius-lg)', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', gap: '12px', paddingBlock: '8px', paddingInline: '12px' }}>\n                  <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style={{ flexShrink: '0', display: 'inline-block' }}>\n                    <path d=\"M219.31,108.68l-80-80a16,16,0,0,0-22.62,0l-80,80A15.87,15.87,0,0,0,32,120v96a8,8,0,0,0,8,8h64a8,8,0,0,0,8-8V160h32v56a8,8,0,0,0,8